{"id":71308,"date":"2026-10-29T19:19:26","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:19:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71308"},"modified":"2026-10-29T20:22:01","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:22:01","slug":"circuito-das-sao-silvestres-de-famalicao","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/circuito-das-sao-silvestres-de-famalicao\/","title":{"rendered":"Circuito das S\u00e3o Silvestres de Famalic\u00e3o 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Circuito das S\u00e3o Silvestres de Famalic\u00e3o 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Circuito das S\u00e3o Silvestres de Famalic\u00e3o 2026<\/strong> arranca no s\u00e1bado, <strong>28 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, \u00e0s <strong>18h00<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>. Este trof\u00e9u municipal re\u00fane num campeonato conjunto <strong>seis provas de S\u00e3o Silvestre<\/strong> emblem\u00e1ticas do concelho \u2014 <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Castel\u00f5es, S\u00e3o Silvestre de Seide, S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vermoim, S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o, S\u00e3o Silvestre de Ribeir\u00e3o e S\u00e3o Silvestre de Esmeriz<\/strong> \u2014, premiando a regularidade e a performance individual e coletiva ao longo da \u00e9poca festiva.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o global no circuito tem o valor \u00fanico de <strong>50,00 \u20ac<\/strong> (aberta at\u00e9 14 de novembro de 2026) e garante entrada autom\u00e1tica nas seis corridas principais (tipicamente de <strong>10 km<\/strong> em estrada), T-shirt nas etapas que a incluem e o exclusivo <strong>Trof\u00e9u Especial Finisher<\/strong>, composto por uma base pr\u00f3pria onde encaixam os seis pins conquistados \u00e0 medida que o atleta conclui cada prova. Para o ranking geral (Sub-23, S\u00e9nior, V40, V50 e V60) contam as quatro melhores pontua\u00e7\u00f5es em seis etapas, distribuindo um total de <strong>1.500 \u20ac em pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios<\/strong> para o Top 5 Geral Masculino e Feminino. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direct