ckground: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pack Global 6 Provas + Trof\u00e9u Especial (6 Pins):<\/strong> 50,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as seis provas que integram o Circuito das S\u00e3o Silvestres de Famalic\u00e3o 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O circuito \u00e9 constitu\u00eddo por seis corridas no concelho de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o: S\u00e3o Silvestre de Castel\u00f5es, S\u00e3o Silvestre de Seide, S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vermoim, S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o, S\u00e3o Silvestre de Ribeir\u00e3o e S\u00e3o Silvestre de Esmeriz.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quanto custa e o que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o global no Circuito?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o global custa 50,00 \u20ac (dispon\u00edvel at\u00e9 14 de novembro de 2026) e inclui inscri\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica nas 6 provas integrantes, T-shirt nas provas que a oferecem e direito exclusivo ao Trof\u00e9u Especial do Circuito composto por uma estrutura pr\u00f3pria e 6 pins colecion\u00e1veis.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quantas provas \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio concluir para entrar na classifica\u00e7\u00e3o final?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Para figurar na classifica\u00e7\u00e3o final individual ou coletiva \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio concluir pelo menos 4 das 6 provas, contabilizando-se as 4 melhores pontua\u00e7\u00f5es. Existem ainda bonifica\u00e7\u00f5es de +10 pontos para quem concluir 5 provas, +20 pontos para quem concluir as 6 provas e +10 pontos pela conclus\u00e3o da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral do Circuito?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Circuito distribui 1.500 \u20ac em pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios (750 \u20ac na Geral Masculina e 750 \u20ac na Geral Feminina) pelos 5 primeiros classificados: 250 \u20ac (1\u00ba), 200 \u20ac (2\u00ba), 150 \u20ac (3\u00ba), 100 \u20ac (4\u00ba) e 50 \u20ac (5\u00ba).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios em disputa?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O circuito contempla classifica\u00e7\u00f5es masculinas e femininas nos escal\u00f5es Sub-23 (18\u201323 anos), S\u00e9nior (24\u201339 anos), Veteranos 40 (40\u201349 anos), Veteranos 50 (50\u201359 anos) e Veteranos 60 (+60 anos), al\u00e9m de classifica\u00e7\u00e3o coletiva por equipas.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Circuito das S\u00e3o Silvestres de Famalic\u00e3o 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-28\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-28\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o, Braga\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Circuito das S\u00e3o Silvestres de Famalic\u00e3o 2026 arranca a 28 de novembro em Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o com 6 provas (Castel\u00f5es, Seide, Vermoim, Ribeir\u00e3o). Inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-circuito-das-sao-silvestres-de-famalicao.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Global no Circuito (6 Provas de S\u00e3o Silvestre \u2014 10 km)\", \"price\": \"50.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sinctime.com\/evento\/560\"}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Munic\u00edpio de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as seis provas que integram o Circuito das S\u00e3o Silvestres de Famalic\u00e3o 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O circuito \u00e9 constitu\u00eddo por seis corridas no concelho de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o: S\u00e3o Silvestre de Castel\u00f5es, S\u00e3o Silvestre de Seide, S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vermoim, S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o, S\u00e3o Silvestre de Ribeir\u00e3o e S\u00e3o Silvestre de Esmeriz.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quanto custa e o que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o global no Circuito?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o global custa 50,00 \u20ac (dispon\u00edvel at\u00e9 14 de novembro de 2026) e inclui inscri\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica nas 6 provas integrantes, T-shirt nas provas que a oferecem e direito exclusivo ao Trof\u00e9u Especial do Circuito composto por uma estrutura pr\u00f3pria e 6 pins colecion\u00e1veis.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quantas provas \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio concluir para entrar na classifica\u00e7\u00e3o final?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Para figurar na classifica\u00e7\u00e3o final individual ou coletiva \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio concluir pelo menos 4 das 6 provas, contabilizando-se as 4 melhores pontua\u00e7\u00f5es. Existem ainda bonifica\u00e7\u00f5es de +10 pontos para quem concluir 5 provas, +20 pontos para quem concluir as 6 provas e +10 pontos pela conclus\u00e3o da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Famalic\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral do Circuito?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Circuito distribui 1.500 \u20ac em pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios (750 \u20ac na Geral Masculina e 750 \u20ac na Geral Feminina) pelos 5 primeiros classificados: 250 \u20ac (1\u00ba), 200 \u20ac (2\u00ba), 150 \u20ac (3\u00ba), 100 \u20ac (4\u00ba) e 50 \u20ac (5\u00ba).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios em disputa?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O circuito contempla classifica\u00e7\u00f5es masculinas e femininas nos escal\u00f5es Sub-23 (18\u201323 anos), S\u00e9nior (24\u201339 anos), Veteranos 40 (40\u201349 anos), Veteranos 50 (50\u201359 anos) e Veteranos 60 (+60 anos), al\u00e9m de classifica\u00e7\u00e3o coletiva por equipas.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":71310,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,47],"event_type_2":[52,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-71308","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-famalicao-porto","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-sao-silvestre","event_type_2-braga","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-circuito-das-sao-silvestres-de-famalicao.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/71308","ta